  {
   "id": "human-fall-flat-16992@major-2025-10-30",
   "gameId": "human-fall-flat-16992",
   "displayName": "It’s cozy season, so many reasons to stay in with Human Fall Flat!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-10-30T14:04:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello humans,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It’s cozy season and we have so many reasons for you to be staying in having chaotic fun playing Human Fall Flat!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Firstly an amazing bundle deal to get you or your friends started:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Buy Escape The Backrooms X Human Fall Flat Bundle at 51% off",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Escape the Backrooms is a 1-4 player co-op horror exploration game. Traverse through eerie backrooms levels while avoiding entities and other dangers to try and escape.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More ways to customise your human, we have added 5 new costumes – Skater, Sheriff, Cat, Frog Bucket hat and Rockabilly King hair!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "No tricks, there are already Halloween themed costumes ready and waiting for tomorrow!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Official levels finished? Don't stop the fun! The community has cooked up some absolutely banger levels in the Workshop!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Feeling like a big brain? Dive into Temple 2 and Keys!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Want to scream and cling to your friends? The Cabin in the Woods and Hive Experiment: Breach are waiting!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ready to break physics (and your friends' patience)? The Gravity House will have you laughing too hard to stand!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Or try your luck in the Casino, get mysterious in Nightfall, and chill out in Snowy Mountain.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So many epic maps to explore! Grab your floppiest friends, head to the Steam Workshop Homepage, and get ready for your next week of chaos!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Bored after work/school? You know where to go. The Workshop is a treasure trove of fun!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Begin your next great fall today!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
